# Core Package Module Structure Guidelines

## Import Style

Imports should follow this exact pattern:

```typescript
import { ExternalType } from "external-package";
import { AnotherExternal } from "another-package";

import * as ModuleName from "../module-name/index.js";
import { SpecificType } from "../global/index.js";
import * as AnotherModule from "../another-module/index.js";
```

**Rules:**
- External imports first (from node_modules)
- Empty line separator
- Internal imports second (from other modules in the project)
- Internal module imports should always use `* as ModuleName` format
- All internal imports must use `.js` extension
- Specific type imports from global are allowed with destructuring

