## File Organization
```
src/
├── module-name/
│   ├── index.ts          # Main module file
│   └── tests/            # Test directory (if tests exist)
│       ├── utility1.test.ts      # Function/constant tests
│       ├── utility2.test.ts      # Function/constant tests
│       ├── TypeName.type.test.ts  # Type tests
│       └── ...
```